From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 19:43:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 268/271] Seats: two more Ofcom drama blocks (Birmingham,
 Edinburgh)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Tester box 57158: POST /admin/test-accounts answered „no free number left"
in every fictional range, so no new seat could be made. Adds 0121 496
0000–0999 and 0131 496 0000–0999, both reserved by Ofcom for fiction, as
blocks ten and eleven; nothing is freed or deleted. Numbers are ours to
decide (§110).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
---
 .../__tests__/fictionIsReservedFiction.test.ts     | 14 ++++++++++++--
 src/services/fictionalNumbers.ts                   |  8 ++++++++
 2 files changed, 20 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/services/__tests__/fictionIsReservedFiction.test.ts b/src/services/__tests__/fictionIsReservedFiction.test.ts
